<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Elan Corp says Q1 net income $37.15 mln.</title>
<headline>Elan Corp says Q1 net income $37.15 mln.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			  (million $ unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (cents)		0.36		   vs 0.35</p>
<p> Net income		 37.15		  vs 28.62</p>
<p> Total revenues	   89.05		  vs 74.86</p>
<p> Operating expenses     57.51		  vs 51.56</p>
<p> Operating income	 31.54		  vs 23.30</p>
<p> Net income before tax  37.55		  vs 28.69</p>
<p> Taxation		   0.39 charge	  vs 0.07 charge</p>
<p>NOTE - Elan Corp Plc is a worldwide drug delivery and biopharmaceutical company.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
